.TH DANBY-JUPITERBOOST 1
.SH NAME
danby-jupiterboost \- heliocentric speed change in a Jupiter flyby
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/jupiterboost
.SH MODEL
A massless spacecraft encounters moving Jupiter in the Sun's field. Its
heliocentric speed and Jupiter distance show the energy exchange during the
gravity assist; signed aim offset selects leading or trailing encounters.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/jupiterboost.b
